{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x/y = 3/4 হলে, (x + y)/(x - y) = ?", "option1": "ক) -7", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 7", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x/y = 3/4<br />বা,&nbsp;(x + y)/(x - y) = (3 + 4)/(3 - 4) [যোজন বিয়োজন করে]&nbsp;<br />&there4;&nbsp;(x + y)/(x - y) = -7</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x - 5y = 16 এবং x + 3y = 0 হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -6", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x - 5y = 16......(1)<br />x + 3y = 0.......(2)<br />(1) নং থেকে (2) নং বিয়োগ করে পাই,<br />-8y = 16<br />&there4; y = -2<br />y এর মান (2) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,<br />x - 6 = 0<br />&there4; x = 6</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) (2x + y, 10) = (7, 3x + y) হলে, (x, y) = কত?", "option1": "ক) (-3, 1)", "option2": "খ) (-3, -1)", "option3": "গ) (3, -1)", "option4": "ঘ) (3, 1)", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(2x + y, 10) = (7, 3x + y)<br />বা, 2x + y = 7.......(1)<br />এবং 3x + y = 10......(2)<br /><br />(2) নং থেকে (1) নং বিয়োগ করে পাই,<br />x = 3<br />এখন,<br />(1) নং এ x এর মান বসিয়ে পাই,<br />2.3 + y = 7<br />বা, y = 7 - 6<br />= 1<br /><br />&there4; (x, y) = (3, 1)</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) x + 2y = 4 এবং xy = 2 হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x + 2y = 4.........(1)<br />এবং xy = 2<br />বা, y = 2/x<br /><br />(1) নং থেকে পাই x + 2.2/x = 4<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 4 = 4x<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 4 = 0<br />বা, (x - 2)<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />বা, x - 2 = 0<br />&there4; x = 2</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x = 2y = 3z এবং xyz = 36 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) -6", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x = 2y = 3z<br />&there4; y = x/2<br />এবং<br />z = x/3<br /><br />xyz = 36<br />বা, x.x/2.x/3 = 36<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> = 2 &times; 3&nbsp;&times; 36<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> = 216<br />&there4; x = 6</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) 3/(x - 1) = 4/(x + 2) এর সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 20", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>3/(x - 1) = 4/(x + 2)<br />বা, 4x - 4 = 3x + 6<br />বা, 4x - 3x = 6 + 4<br />&there4; x = 10</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 100 এবং x - y = 2 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 8", "option2": "খ) 7", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ y<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 100.......(1)<br />এবং, x - y = 2.......(2)<br /><br />(1) নং থেকে পাই,<br />x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ y<sup>2</sup> = 100<br />বা, (x - y)<sup>2</sup> + 2xy = 100<br />বা, 2<sup>2</sup> + 2xy = 100<br />বা, 2xy = 100 - 4<br />বা, 2xy = 96<br />&there4; xy = 48<br /><br />আবার, (1) নং থেকে<br />x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ y<sup>2</sup> = 100<br />বা, (x + y)<sup>2</sup> - 2xy = 100<br />বা, (x + y)<sup>2</sup> - 96 = 100<br />বা,&nbsp;(x + y)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 196<br />বা, x + y = 14......(3)<br /><br />(2) ও (3) নং যোগ করে পাই,<br />2x = 16<br />&there4; x = 8</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) (x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>0</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) x", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>0</sup><br />= x<sup>2&times;0</sup><br />= x<sup>0</sup><br />= 1</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) (&radic;2)<sup>8</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 14", "option2": "খ) 15", "option3": "গ) 16", "option4": "ঘ) 17", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>(&radic;2)<sup>8</sup>&nbsp;<br />= (2<sup>1/2</sup>)<sup>8</sup><br />= 2<sup>4</sup><br />= 16</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) <sup>3</sup>&radic;x<sup>4</sup> = 4 হলে x<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 8", "option2": "খ) 2&radic;2", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><sup>3</sup>&radic;x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;= 4<br />বা, (<sup>3</sup>&radic;x<sup>4</sup>)<sup>3</sup> = (4)<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>[উভয় পক্ষকে ঘন করে]<br />বা, x<sup>4</sup> = 64<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> = &radic;64 